0 was accepted with no error and dashboard showed \\\"Guest Count -10\\\". Saving 12.7 was also accepted and dashboard showed \\\"Guest Count 12.7\\\". No validation message shown; previously saved count was replaced in both cases.\", \"evidence\": \"Dashboard Guest Count read \\\"-10\\\" then \\\"12.7\\\" after saving invalid values\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Favorites and saved checklists survived navigation across Venues/Vendors/Favorites/Checklists/Dashboard, and a full reload of http://localhost:6004/. After reload: /favorites shows Saved Venues (1) Rosewood Garden Estate and Saved Vendors (2) Eternal Moments Photography + Bloom & Petal Studio; Ceremony Planning still badged \\\"Saved\\\". localStorage favoriteVenues [\\\"v1\\\"], favoriteVendors [\\\"vn1\\\",\\\"vn3\\\"], savedChecklists [\\\"cl3\\\"].\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Past wedding dates are accepted; no future-date validation\", \"actual\": \"Saved date was Sep 18, 2027. Entering the past date 2020-01-15 and clicking Save was accepted with no error; the dashboard replaced the saved date and displayed \\\"Wedding Date Jan 15, 2020\\\" (today is 2026-08-28).\", \"evidence\": \"Dashboard Wedding Date after save: \\\"Jan 15, 2020\\\"\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Listing detail views cannot be opened — the detail buttons are inert for both venues and vendors\", \"actual\": \"Venues: clicking \\\"View Details\\\" (Rosewood Garden Estate) left URL at /venues, added no [role=\\\"dialog\\\"] (count 0), no new body portal (children remain DIV#root, SCRIPT), and body innerHTML length was unchanged at 48686. Clicking the card title also did nothing. Vendors: clicking \\\"View Profile\\\" (Eternal Moments Photography) likewise left URL at /vendors, dialogs 0, body portals unchanged, bodyLen 63677 unchanged. No complete-detail view is reachable for any listing.\", \"evidence\": \"Both \\\"View Details\\\" (venues) and \\\"View Profile\\\" (vendors) produce no dialog, navigation, or DOM change\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Ceremony Planning (5 tasks): checking task 1 -> 0%->20%, task 2 -> 40%, unchecking task 2 -> back to 20% (immediate, completedChecklistItems {\\\"cl3-1\\\":true,\\\"cl3-2\\\":false}). Dashboard aggregate \\\"Planning Progress\\\" changed 0% -> 20% and preview \\\"Ceremony Planning 1 of 5 completed\\\". After full page reload, dashboard still 20% / \\\"1 of 5 completed\\\" and the checklist reopened with checkbox states [checked, unchecked, unchecked, unchecked, unchecked] and 20%.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"No submit button exists; results and the \\\"Showing X of Y\\\" count updated immediately on each filter click and on typing in the search box (e.g. venues 8/8 -> 2/8 on Garden click -> 1/8 on adding Moderate; typing \\\"MALIBU\\\" -> 1/8). \\\"Clear all filters\\\" restored 8/8 venues and 10/10 vendors with the search box emptied.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cancelled draft is not discarded from the editor form state\", \"actual\": \"Saved values were Emma Stone / 45000 / 120. Changed to \\\"DRAFT ONE\\\" / 99999 / 555 and clicked Cancel. Dashboard correctly still showed \\\"Emma Stone & Liam Carter\\\", $45,000, 120 (this half passed). But reopening via \\\"Update Details\\\" showed the cancelled draft values in the inputs: [\\\"DRAFT ONE\\\",\\\"Liam Carter\\\",\\\"2027-06-12\\\",\\\"99999\\\",\\\"555\\\"] instead of the last saved values.\", \"evidence\": \"input values after reopen: DRAFT ONE / Liam Carter / 2027-06-12 / 99999 / 555\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Dashboard shows: \\\"Emily Stone & Liam Bennett\\\", \\\"385 days until your special day\\\", Wedding Date \\\"Sep 18, 2027\\\" (formatted), Budget \\\"$52,000\\\", Guest Count \\\"150\\\", Planning Progress \\\"0%\\\", favorite counts \\\"1 saved\\\" venues / \\\"2 saved\\\" vendors, \\\"2 saved\\\" checklists, plus previews: \\\"Your Saved Checklists: Ceremony Planning 0 of 5 completed, Honeymoon Planning 0 of 5 completed\\\" and \\\"Your Favorites: Rosewood Garden Estate, Eternal Moments Photography, Bloom & Petal Studio\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Venue card e.g. \\\"Garden | Luxury ($$$) | Rosewood Garden Estate | Napa Valley, CA | 4.9 | An enchanting garden venue... | Up to 200 guests\\\" — name, location, type, price range, rating, summary, capacity all present. Vendor card e.g. \\\"Photography | Luxury ($$$) | Eternal Moments Photography | Los Angeles, CA | 4.9 | Award-winning wedding photographers... | Candid Shots | Drone Photography | Same-Day Edits\\\" — includes specialties.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Categories Planning (2 checklists: 12+ Months Before, 8-10 Months Before), Ceremony, Reception, Attire, Honeymoon (1 each) — all five covered. Expanding each checklist yields exactly 2 lines per declared task (title + description): 6 tasks=>12 lines, 6=>12, 5=>10, 6=>12, 5=>10, 5=>10, so every task has a title and explanatory description.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Venues search \\\"beach\\\" + price Budget ($) => \\\"Showing 1 of 8 venues\\\", sole result Coastal Haven is Beach/Budget ($) and matches \\\"beach\\\" — satisfies all criteria and count accurate. Zero-result case Garden+Budget => \\\"Showing 0 of 8 venues\\\" with no-match state \\\"No venues match your search. Try adjusting your filters or search terms.\\\" Clear all filters restored 8/8.\"}]}"
